Testing Angular

Kategori: Angular  Minggu 11: Testing Angular

Learning Objectives

Jasmine Karma setup
TestBed for testing environment
ComponentFixture for component testing
Service testing with TestBed.inject
Async testing: fakeAsync, waitForAsync

